    <div class="tab" data-group="primary" data-tab="magen"><section class="sns-magen-panel">
      <h2>MAGEN (DEMONIC ILLUSION)</h2>
      <p><strong>Restricted Hijutsu.</strong> Prerequisites: Intelligence 6; Fascinate, Mirage and Deep Illusion. These cards are references: viewing them does not purchase the power, effects or limited aptitudes. Manage your purchased Magen power in Powers. Levels 6–10 list effect evolutions; they are not invented new base effects.</p>
      {{#if magenError}}<p role="alert">{{magenError}} Reopen the sheet to retry. Confirm the full English system update is installed.</p>{{/if}}
      {{#if magenStats}}<p><strong>Owned Magen level:</strong> {{magenStats.powerLevel}} · Intelligence {{magenStats.intelligence}} · Normal resistance DC {{magenStats.resistanceDC}} · Touch resistance DC {{magenStats.touchDC}} · Range {{magenStats.range}} m. Deep Illusion is already included. Apply effect-specific and target modifiers separately.</p>{{else}}<p>No purchased Magen power was detected. The full reference remains readable.</p>{{/if}}
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><label>Level <select data-magen-filter="level"><option value="">All levels</option><option value="0">Core rules</option>{{#each magenGroups}}<option value="{{level}}">Level {{level}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Illusion type <select data-magen-filter="kind"><option value="">All types</option><option>Rules</option><option>Compulsion</option><option>Affliction</option><option>Phantom</option><option>Limited Aptitude</option></select></label><label>Search <input type="search" data-magen-filter="query" placeholder="Find an effect or rule"></label></div>
      <section class="sns-magen-group"><h3>Core Magen Rules</h3>{{#each magenRules}}<details class="sns-magen-entry sns-box" data-magen-level="0" data-magen-kind="{{kind}}" style="margin:8px 0;padding:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold">{{name}}</summary><p style="white-space:pre-line">{{description}}</p><small>Basic Book, pp. {{pageText}}</small></details>{{/each}}</section>
      {{#each magenGroups}}<section class="sns-magen-group"><h3>Level {{level}}</h3>{{#each entries}}<details class="sns-magen-entry sns-box" data-magen-level="{{level}}" data-magen-kind="{{kind}}" style="margin:8px 0;padding:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold">{{name}} — {{kind}} · {{chakraCost}} Chakra</summary><p><strong>Required Magen level:</strong> {{level}} · <strong>Action:</strong> {{action}}</p><p style="white-space:pre-line">{{description}}</p><small>Basic Book, pp. {{pageText}}</small></details>{{/each}}</section>{{/each}}
      <section class="sns-magen-group"><h3>Limited Aptitudes</h3>{{#each magenMeta}}<details class="sns-magen-entry sns-box" data-magen-level="{{level}}" data-magen-kind="{{kind}}" style="margin:8px 0;padding:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold">{{name}} — Magen {{level}}</summary><p style="white-space:pre-line">{{description}}</p><small>Basic Book, pp. {{pageText}}</small></details>{{/each}}</section>
      <p>Resolve resistance tests, Kai, condition application, target selection and durations manually using the cards. Some source condition names have translation notes.</p>
    </section></div>
